  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nしっかり合ってたな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004020020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ありがと！　自分でもちょっと思ったんだー！\r\nやっぱり見ててもらえると、気付くことが多いよね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400402/2014004020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004020030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、ごめんね\r\nお休みなのにレッスンに付き合ってもらっちゃって",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400402/2014004020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、気にしないで良い\r\nむしろ俺は嬉しいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最近の甘奈は前にもまして頑張ってくれてるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こうして休みの日までレッスンする姿を見られるのは\r\nプロデューサーとして本望だ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004020040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへ……\r\nありがと、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400402/2014004020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004020050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……うーん\r\n……でも、言葉だけじゃ足りない気がするな～",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400402/2014004020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004020060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうだ！\r\n甘奈、プロデューサーさんのために１曲、歌うね☆",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400402/2014004020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？\r\n歌ってくれるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004020070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん！\r\nだから、聴いてもらっても良いかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400402/2014004020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004020080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あっ！　でも、甘奈が歌ってもお礼にはならないよね\r\nえへへ……何か他に……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201400402/2014004020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いいや\r\n甘奈の歌なら大歓迎だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2014004020090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
